    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ PASSOFF- 092 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(What do I do in the afternoon?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "I have lunch at 12:30 p.m. After lunch, I have two more classes."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I finish my classes at 3:00 p.m."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "After school, I go to private academies where I study Art,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Piano and English."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Each academy lesson lasts around fifty minutes."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Sometimes I get very tired when I’m at the academies,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "but I enjoy studying with my friends there."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "After my last academy class, I get home at around 6:00 p.m."
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        "1 번",
